The <arg>newline</arg> argument allows you to specify the control characters used when writing <link text_attributes.csdoc>newlines</link>. Options include:

<list>
    <li><logiccolor>"LF"</logiccolor>: Newlines are written using only the line feed character: <logiccolor>"\n"</logiccolor>.</li>
    <li><logiccolor>"CRLF"</logiccolor>: Newlines are written using a combination of a carriage return and a line feed character: <logiccolor>"\r\n"</logiccolor>.</li>
</list>